# Normalize to LF in the working tree on every platform. Without eol=lf a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF, which then fails `dotnet format --verify-no-changes`
# against the LF setting in .editorconfig.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
